! A join that makes no word completes to one: the word less a final vowel, a few
! letters, then the suffix. Seeded, because the stack holds each of these as an
! outline of its own.
!buffer nun
REU
!buffer ram
KAEUGS
!buffer imagine
SH*UPB
!buffer reserve
SH*UPB
!buffer compete
SH*UPB
! A join nothing is near stands.
!buffer run
SH*UPB
